  "title": "The End of the Billable Hour? AI's Impact on Legal Operations",
  "summary": "AI is dismantling the legal industry billable hour by drastically increasing efficiency. To survive, firms must adopt flat, subscription, or hybrid pricing models. Furthermore, AI revolutionizes document discovery, creates lucrative new roles like compliance experts, and drives the adoption of secure platforms like Lexi to automate research and contract review.",
